 14	---
 15	
 16	## Intent
 17	
 18	A silent, fast surface tour for the Keating landing page. The product itself is
 19	the proof: move from a real browser tutoring exchange to the OpenTUI host and
 20	then to deterministic CLI artifacts without inventing product UI or claims.
 21	
 22	## Assets
 23	
 24	- assets/web-classroom.mp4 — real Gemini-backed browser learning session.
 25	- assets/tui-collaborative.mp4 — real collaborative OpenTUI session.
 26	- assets/cli-artifacts.mp4 — real CLI plan, map, verification, and trace flow.
 27	
 28	## Customizations
 29	
 30	- Keep each source leg selectable as its own landing-page screencast.
 31	- Use clear surface labels and a continuous Web → TUI → CLI handoff.
 32	
 33	## Notes
 34	
 35	- Silent: no narration, music, or sound effects.
 36	- Match the landing page's warm paper, dark ink, and Keating green.
 37	- Preserve the recorded product pixels; do not restyle the footage.
  1	---
  2	format: 1920x1080
  3	duration: 18s
  4	message: "One learning question can move between Keating's web, TUI, and CLI surfaces"
  5	arc: Web question → TUI collaboration → CLI artifacts
  6	audience: prospective self-directed learners
  7	mode: autonomous
  8	music: none
  9	---
 10	
 11	## Frame 1 — Web classroom
 12	
 13	- status: animated
 14	- src: index.html
 15	- duration: 6s
 16	- poster: 3s
 17	- transition_in: cut
 18	- scene: A real streamed tutoring exchange fills the frame beside the WEB rail.
 19	- asset_candidates: assets/web-classroom.mp4
 20	
 21	At 0.0s the surface label arrives from the left while the footage settles from
 22	0.3–0.8s. Hold on the learner question, public reasoning, and useful follow-up.
 23	
 24	## Frame 2 — Collaborative TUI
 25	
 26	- status: animated
 27	- src: index.html
 28	- duration: 6s
 29	- poster: 9s
 30	- transition_in: cut
 31	- scene: The OpenTUI collaborative host continues the work inside the terminal.
 32	- asset_candidates: assets/tui-tour.mp4
 33	
 34	At 6.0s the rail advances to TUI; the real host footage settles at 6.3s. Keep
 35	the project-context and artifact lookup visible through the hold.
 36	
 37	## Frame 3 — Artifact CLI
 38	
 39	- status: animated
 40	- src: index.html
 41	- duration: 6s
 42	- poster: 15s
 43	- transition_in: cut
 44	- scene: The CLI generates and inspects a plan, map, verification, and trace.
 45	- asset_candidates: assets/cli-artifacts.mp4
 46	
 47	At 12.0s the rail advances to CLI; the terminal footage settles at 12.3s and
 48	holds on the inspectable outputs through the end.
 49	
 50	## Video direction
 51	
 52	Warm paper, dark ink, and one Keating-green accent. The real screen capture is
 53	always the dominant focal point; the numbered rail supplies orientation and the
 54	bottom tracker makes the Web → TUI → CLI progression explicit. Motion stays
 55	seek-safe and finite. No narration, music, SFX, invented UI, or extra claims.
